    Do that luc lat: `sample_default_args_itertools` bao
    "AST node khong ro: 1000056". Nen phep dat lai nay chuyen ra dau hai
    duong vao that su, xem `reset_pool_bieu_thuc` duoc goi o tkv_compile.
    """
    return


