             # bien 'thread' co the giu Task<T> VOI T KHAC NHAU trong CUNG
             # 1 ham (vd worker tra i64 va worker tra str) - CIL doi hoi
             # kieu local CO DINH, nen dung 'object' lam kieu luu chung
             # (Task<T> luon la reference type, gan duoc vao object khong
             # can ep kieu), roi castclass ve dung Task<T> luc thread_join
